Decision: the context panel exposes one current total, derived from the same seven category buckets displayed below it.

The provider input measurement, output count, provenance and preparation status remain internal for compression and diagnostics. A completed preparation is no longer reused as the visible breakdown because it predates the assistant response; Beaver rebuilds the buckets from the persisted current conversation instead.

Reason: a user-facing panel must not present several incomparable token authorities as if they described the same moment.

